From: Duy Truong <duytruong@google.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 03:54:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Fix OOB in DynamicsProcessing MBC band processing

Clamp cutoffFrequency and add bounds checks in MBC loops
to prevent heap out-of-bounds read-modify-write.
The vulnerability allowed an attacker to control the OOB
extent via a crafted cutoffFrequency value.

This change was autogenerated by MendIt (go/androidmendit)

Bug: 505827492
Test: manual compilation and host-side logic test
Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
Cherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:5070aaf57af03a314048990fbb53b38e6e0411bb
