 .../aidl/DynamicsProcessingContext.cpp             |  5 +++++
 media/libeffects/dynamicsproc/dsp/DPFrequency.cpp  | 14 ++++++++++----
 3 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

